        <profile name="Nurgle&apos;s Gift" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities" hidden="false" id="832d-2960-48f7-1945">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">All DEATH GUARD units within 7&quot; of a friendly LORD OF CONTAGION are surrounded by a deadly aura of plague and disease. Roll a dice for each enemy unit that is within 1&quot; of any affected friendly units at the start of your turn; on a 4+ that enemy unit suffers a mortal wound.</characteristic>
