      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">If a Myphitic Blight-hauler is reduced to 0 Wounds, roll a dice before removing it from the battlefield, on a 4+ it Explodes, and each unit within 7&quot; suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
